  [slugs.blocks,'Compare blocks and brackets when mounting faces and intersecting passages are the main drawing requirements, alongside this example of cavities and angled surfaces.'],
  [slugs.multiFace,'Compare the multi-sided example when ports and bolt patterns on several faces need shared datums; it makes those relationships the review focus.'],
  [slugs.contours,'Compare contoured components when blade profiles and root transitions require a controlling surface model, beyond pocket and bore definitions.'],
 ]),
